    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "char_187_ccheal_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Gyuh! That... That reaper's whirlwind... And that hairclip... Y-you're Gavial!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The one and only!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it. Just our luck, running into you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "But don't get ahead of yourself, Gavial! Not even you could shake our faith in thick tails!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, you're such hot shit! Keep running!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, let's move. I can sort them out the next time I see them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_jungleentrance",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, how come you let them go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "You used to chase down every last person in a fight and beat them until they saw stars.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. I used to do that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "But nah, now I just think they're kind of cute. Right, Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "No idea what you're saying, but I agree.;......;Cuter than you breaking them in half.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Might sound strange coming from me, but this place is full of nothing but boneheads.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, whatever. Have to think all the goddamn time outside. I almost miss it here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Doctor, don't tell me you're a thick tail lover?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Cause we're not gonna see eye-to-eye on that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah! Well, thinking they're cute won't stop me beating the tar outta them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're not... uh... what's the word...? Mutually exclusive!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial... you really have changed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm? Hold on, Tomimi, you little brat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I go away for a couple years and I come back to find your tail's even fatter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-wh-whuh?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Gonna try and tell me you're with thick tails, too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No no no no! It's not like I wanted it to grow so thick!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Whimper* I want a nice, thin tail just like Gavial's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, shucks. *Clicks tongue* What a poor kid you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though watching you fight back there, your Arts are pretty strong now, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "R... Really?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. Come over to Rhodes Island and be an operator. Should be no problem for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ope... rator?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Operators are, uh... Well, I guess it's a job. Like me, I'm a Medic Operator.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember you were still learning from the shamans when I left, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep! I've been disciplining myself every day for you, Gavial, so one day you'd come back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "For me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... um, by that, I mean, for when you come back so I could help you out! Like I did just now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, damn. You really did help out, then. Well done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eheheh... I love when you compliment me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Cool. Let's keep moving then. Do I remember the Temple's just ahead?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm-hm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_jungleentrance",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Eunectes has to be the Great Chief, c'mon. Look at how strong the whole tribe is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, and she's top of the pile. Everyone said if not Gavial, then Eunectes, and now Gavial's gone...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "name2": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, over there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "name2": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No way... Gavial?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Gavial! You're finally back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa! Long time no see, huh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_jungleentrance",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, that feather on your waist is nice! Where'd it come from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Traded one of my weapons to Inam for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "name2": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Man, your tribe really has it good. Inam can get her hands on anything. I wish I could be with you guys too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "name2": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Too bad. Inam hates crowds. But if there's anything you guys want, you can go through me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Deal! ...Hey. Look over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that... wait, it's Gavial!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "name2": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's actually back?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_072"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial! So you weren't dead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Alive and well, baby!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_jungleentrance",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Brother, come on. Stop trying to make a show. You've got the Stone Disease and all. Just go back home and lie down, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who cares! What's a little disease in the face of the ceremony?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A little disease is still disease! And think about how bad it'd be for us if you went out there and showed everyone the rocks growing on your tail!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, Gavial might be gone, but now Zumama's sure to be the next Great Chief!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the part I care about! I need to witness the moment Zumama becomes Chief!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damnit, I should have listened to Zumama... huh? Brother, look over there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It couldn't be. Is that... Gavial?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has she come back to become Great Chief?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm sorry, but now I HAVE to see the ceremony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. I don't think anyone can miss this now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Those two look like they're from the Eunectes tribe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_jungleentrance",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
