        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It really is Gavial! You're finally back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I always believed in you, Gavial!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, everyone, look! It's Gavial!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial! Gavial! Gavial!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Whew, what a rowdy bunch... Looks like we oughta pick up the pace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm-hm! Everyone loves the ceremony, after all. And everyone loves Gavial too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. Gavial, look at that sign there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemme see. Tch, goddamned scratchy handwriting... Oh, look at that. It says 'Mahuizzotia.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_temple_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$bat_Imfxingback_intro",
        "key": "$bat_Imfxingback_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait. What gives with the music?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "And for that matter, why do I recognize it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait! Doctor, this is an AUS song, isn't it?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Definitely.;......;Is it?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, damn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not totally sure myself, but I've definitely heard people playing this before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Snap out of it, Doctor! Don't just walk in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "Lots of AUS fans at Rhodes Island. That's gotta be it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah. Yep, this is an AUS song.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you know what AUS is?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Around this time last year, a bunch of strange people calling themselves AUS came here from the outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "They held a concert at Inam's tribe first. After that, a whole lot of Tiacauh started treating them like heralds of the Mahuizzotia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Later on, they were asked to stay for a long performance in the Temple surroundings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I got to hear them once. Their music really was powerful, and beautiful... you could feel their awesome Arts, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ever since, lots of Tiacauh fell in love with this kind of music.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "And then suddenly one day, they disappeared. Everyone said they'd gone back to their ancestors' embrace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I knew they'd only left, same as Gavial had.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "The music playing right now should be coming from those 'speaker' things they left here. I think they also left behind some of their albums?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Speakers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep. They need Arts to function, so only priests and shamans can actually use them, and most of them are in Inam's tribe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#5",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha! Now that's a band of freewheelers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can't deny, their songs really get up in there. I haven't even stepped in and they've got my blood running hot. I think I'm beginning to like them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go, Doctor! We're gonna hear some music and enjoy a hell of a show!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
